# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEXELVORIA Academy - frontend environment template.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and adjust. Every variable here is
# PUBLIC: Vite inlines anything prefixed VITE_ into the JavaScript bundle, so
# it is readable by anyone who opens the site.
#
# NEVER put a secret, API key, token, password or connection string in a
# VITE_ variable. Secrets belong in the backend's own environment.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# API base URL
#
# LEAVE THIS UNSET for normal local development. Unset, `apiClient` uses the
# relative path `/api/v1`, which `vite.config.ts` proxies to
# http://localhost:4000 - so the browser sees one origin and CORS never
# applies.
#
# Set it only to bypass the proxy and call a backend directly, e.g. a
# deployed environment:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com/api/v1
# A direct call is subject to the backend's CORS_ORIGINS allow-list.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_API_URL=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mock authentication escape hatch - TRANSITIONAL
#
# Unset (the default) means student registration calls the REAL backend.
#
# Set to exactly `true` to restore the old all-localStorage behaviour. The
# only reason this exists: OTP verification has no backend yet, because
# BR-001 requires a mobile OTP while BR-014 disables SMS (open-questions Q3).
# Until those endpoints exist, the full
# register -> verify OTP -> dashboard journey works only in mock mode.
#
# DELETE this variable, and the code that reads it, once OTP is real.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_USE_MOCK_AUTH=true

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Analytics measurement id. Optional; analytics no-ops without it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_GA_TRACKING_ID=
